  "en": {
   "name": "The lake Krimsko",
   "subtitle": "Podpeško) jezero",
   "description": "In the lake Krimsko (Podpeško) jezero (up to 51m deep) you can fish for big and healthy carps, pikes, beautiful chubs, tenches, perches as well as huge silver carps. The lake is part of the landscape park Ljubljansko barje and is a true jewel of nature! You can even fish in the winter time because the lake's surface rarely freezes. There is a cozy inn near the lake serving slovenian food."
  },
