   "description": "The Mali graben is a small river which flows into the Ljubljanica in the centre of Ljubljana. The fishermen fish for chubs, barbels, trouts and graylings here all year long but the winter time is ideal to fish for huchens and the pools of the Mali graben hide many of them."
